```
===================================================================
Detection Name: Suricata Network Intrusion Detection Alerts
Author: SOC Team
Data Source: index=ids_suricata (eve.json alerts)
MITRE ATT&CK: T1071 (Application Layer Protocol: C2 Beaconing)
Severity: High
Description: Ingests real-time alerts from Suricata IDS, identifying 
             malware communication, trojan beacons (e.g. Cobalt Strike),
             and suspicious outbound traffic.
===================================================================
```
index=ids_suricata event_type=alert
| table _time, alert.signature, alert.category, alert.severity, src_ip, dest_ip, dest_port
| sort - _time
